  abilityDesc: 18 combo Water attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    5 combo Water attack on single foe (damage relative to remaining HP), boosts
    BC efficacy for 3 turns, restores HP, boosts Atk relative to Def for 3 turns
    & adds Thunder shield for 3 turns
